{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_03",
  "title": "豈可空手回天府？",
  "storyCode": "HE-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "da7be67d0d737de7d069103d33ae5a096891084f58268597c3ff598c76ce2c04",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "我們一般不會用銃招待客人，特殊情況除外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "如果有哪裡招待不周，還請諒解一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扭曲的怪物",
      "text": "（無意義的吼叫）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（對我說的話沒有任何反應，完全無法溝通嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（身體看起來已經不剩多少人類的特徵了，覆蓋在身上的那些是鱗？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（......這種異變，我記得伊比利亞那邊的資料裡曾經提過......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "你難道真的是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "嘶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "輪椅還是太不方便了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（......奇怪，有哪裡不對勁。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（它的攻擊目標......好像不是我？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（它在瞄準哪裡？它的目標是——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "好險......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（......算了，現在管不了這麼多了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "不能看我是不方便移動的傷患就想欺負人哦，這位客人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扭曲的怪物",
      "text": "（尖銳的嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "站住——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "這可不行，不能就這麼讓你逃走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人們在閒聊時總會提起拉特蘭。\n他們說那裡明亮，富足，人人安居，沒有爭吵。\n他們說那裡是真正的人間樂園。\n其實大家都知道，修道院已經在外漂泊好幾十年，真正見過拉特蘭的人已經很少了。或許還有那麼兩三位，或許只剩下主教斯特凡諾。\n人們提起拉特蘭，不過是懷念一個早該醒來的夢。\n夢裡陽光明媚，鮮花滿地。\n就像許多年前，修道院曾展現過的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......它們快要謝了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "今年花開得比往年要早，我猜到謝得應該也會早一些，只是沒想到會這麼快......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "剛剛被摘下的那幾朵開得很好，還沒到凋謝的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "真漂亮。是準備送給什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......來不及了，已經送不出去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "它們救不了任何人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "悲傷。痛苦。絕望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "嗯......很複雜的弦音，還有其他的情感藏在你的體內......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "你在憤怒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "不敢......阿爾圖羅小姐是主教閣下的客人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "只是不敢。很坦誠的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "我的直覺一向非常準確，花匠先生，你似乎有點討厭我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "沒這回事，您想多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "如果你有任何煩惱，我想我可以幫你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......幫我？呃，我不明白您的意思，阿爾圖羅小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "幫我什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "這取決於你的想法，而不是由我決定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "當然，你也可能並不需要什麼幫助。你可以指責我多管閒事，也可以說我不懷好意，都沒問題，這些都是你說了算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "我只是想聽聽你的想法......你自己的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "您是個怪人，阿爾圖羅小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "謝謝你誇我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......您剛剛說可以幫我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "當然，只要你需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "不，我不需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "或許您可以......您能幫助很多人，但您幫不了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅小姐，難道您能做到起死回生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "我做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "您能令作物豐收，讓冷風停止嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "很遺憾，我不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "那麼，您能讓我們回到原本的生活，能讓那些已經產生的隔閡不再嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "您根本做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "那麼你呢，克萊芒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "難道你從沒有想過，親手去解決你所說的這一切問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......我試過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "但是沒有辦法。我試過不止一次，但我做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "我們越是努力，往往事情就會變得越糟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "沒人能讓一切都好起來，主教閣下不能，杰拉爾德不能......我也不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "您幫不了我，阿爾圖羅小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "我請您......不要再說這樣的話。我也不需要您這樣的人的幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "您問我的想法，那我就告訴您：我什麼想法也沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "我還能想什麼？接下來的這個冬天太冷了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "寒冷。是的，那顆心臟就如一片被冰霜封凍的土壤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "可我能觸到那些潛藏在冰封之下的音符......它們究竟會有多動人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "......還不到時候，這支樂曲還沒到完成的時候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "這是多麼難熬的忍耐......嗯......在這種時候，我可克制不住自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "讓我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "text": "啊，這首的旋律正合適現在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "費德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我告訴過你，你的曲調太規律，太順遂。你應當明白，順理成章的旋律總是缺乏令人顫動的情感，既無溫度，亦無激情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有時，我也難免有些好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "費德里科，你究竟什麼時候才能意識到......自己因何在追尋呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "（......琴聲？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "（不對，這不是單純的琴聲，還有源石技藝在其中產生影響。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "（這個源石技藝，以及曲調，難道是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "（聲音越來越接近了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "（......在上方？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "text": "今天這是什麼曲子？真好聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "這裡每天都能聽到樂曲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚嚇的居民",
      "text": "呃！您、您是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "公證所執行者費德里科。請回答我的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚嚇的居民",
      "text": "公證所？那是什麼......哦，我知道了，您就是他們說的拉特蘭來的客人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚嚇的居民",
      "text": "這音樂，呃，這段時間偶爾會有吧？我也不太清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚嚇的居民",
      "text": "對了！好像是聽說在聖堂附近有人拉琴什麼的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "聖堂在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚嚇的居民",
      "text": "就在頂樓，從外側的樓梯上去就是——哎，這位、這位客人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚嚇的居民",
      "text": "跑什麼......真是個怪人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "頭兒，你回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "嗯，出發準備得怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "都差不多了，大家也沒多少東西要帶，帶多了也走不動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "不過出去探路的小子們還沒消息......不知道明早趕不趕得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "再等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "我和斯特凡諾已經說好，我們要走的事......他不會阻攔。所以不必太急著行動，如果到夜裡還沒消息，我親自帶隊去找人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "沒問題，一會我和大家說一聲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "對了，頭兒！還有個事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "赫曼也還沒回來......這附近我都找過了，哪裡都沒見到人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "......萊蒙德也還沒回來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "知道了，這邊交給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "可要是赫曼一直不出現，我們......還等嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "最多等到明天早上，參加完晨會，如果到時候人還沒回來，你和萊蒙德就按計劃帶上其他人出發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "可是，頭兒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "我會留下。活要見人死要見屍，我會找到赫曼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "放心，我不會丟下你們中的任何一個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "......我們擔心的就是你這點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "*含糊的發音*，你總往自己身上攬太多東西了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "......那個名字就別提了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "你們喊我一聲頭兒，我就有責任帶你們找條活路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "我看你是把自己往絕路上逼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "哈哈哈，我有分寸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "行了，別做這副表情。去吧，都準備起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "交班。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "哇......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "嚇了我一跳......是你啊，斯普莉雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "不是我還能是誰？費德里科耐煩幹這活嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "房間裡的那姑娘怎麼樣了......狀態很差？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "不算好。一直沒說過話，看起來受的打擊不小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "我去看了現場，你一點也不好奇到底發生了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "這個嘛......大概能猜到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "銃的威力你我都清楚。這個出血量......是不是人已經不行了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "看你的表情，看來是我猜對了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "你把這事告訴她了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "什麼？哦，你說受傷的人可能已經死亡這事？當然沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "對方的情緒不穩定，告訴她實情反而會有點麻煩......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "所以你是怎麼說的？騙她說應該沒出事，總之先糊弄過去，是不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "你說得真不好聽......不過，我沒什麼要反駁的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "斯普莉雅，你的情緒好像有點不對勁。發生了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......和你沒關係。我好得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "你這麼說，那我就當你沒問題了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "那斯普莉雅，這裡就交給你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "哼，一個個都是靠不住的混蛋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "（銃械走火造成的意外......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "（哈，這算什麼？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "（如果當時我沒有幫她......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "什麼事，簡短彙報。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......等會，什麼叫有薩卡茲出現在周邊地帶，還在嘗試突破你們的封鎖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "只有幾個人？是出來探路的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "行，我知道了。你說奧倫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "不，你們不用管奧倫那邊，我會和他聯繫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "聽我的，接下來你們就這麼辦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "......真是......有夠能跑的啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "還是追丟了嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（如果是從前，這種程度的對手早就該收拾掉了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（在這種時候......還是會忍不住稍微有點生氣呢。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "在那邊嗎......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "看來，現在還不是自怨自艾的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "（琴聲越來越清晰，正在逐步接近來源。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "（但源石技藝的強度在減弱，是放棄了施術，還是......嗯？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "費德里科先生？您怎麼會在這......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "不是說你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "呃，什麼......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "是迷路了嗎？您不介意的話，我可以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "別說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "唔？！唔唔唔！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "那是......剛剛那是什麼？那個怪物是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "它往下逃了！糟了......那邊是杰拉爾德他們住的地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "別動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "有人過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......我聽到這裡有銃聲，所以過來碰碰運氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "樞機輔佐官蕾繆安，斯普莉雅的彙報中提及你不會外出行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "別怪斯普莉雅，我原本確實是那麼打算的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "只是遇到了一點意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "敘舊先放一邊，只有你一個人嗎，費德里科？其他人沒有和你一起行動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "只有我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "那麼長話短說，我正在追蹤一位忽然出現的......客人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "費德里科，不會耽擱你太久......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "來吧，請告訴我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "我的那位“客人”，它往哪個方向去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
